      "fetch_status": "ok",
      "candidate_urls_count": 1,
      "content": "A self-study module, intended for students who will be pursuing a Master\u2019s degree after completing the required Honours-modules. The content is discussed with the candidate by the research supervisor and will focus on a detailed literature study aimed towards preparation for the research dissertation or, in some cases, a specific selected topic. Registration for this module is approved by the Head of Department.",
